  <data name="The sections below have no data source in the system yet, so they are named rather than silently omitted:" xml:space="preserve"><value>Bagian di bawah ini belum memiliki sumber data di sistem, jadi tetap disebutkan daripada dihilangkan diam-diam:</value></data>
